<p>The idea is neat, but the tone is iffy at times.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Some&nbsp;of&nbsp;this&nbsp;may&nbsp;be&nbsp;personal&nbsp;preference</a></div>
